// Card #1593: stream.peer_identity() exposes the negotiated cipher_suite and
// tls_version. A local HTTPS server (D-TLSSERVE1 named tls: option) proves both
// deterministically: pinning bounds to .Tls13 makes the negotiated protocol
// Tls13 and the suite a TLS13_* name. The certificates are the checked-in
// hermetic localhost fixtures (tests/fixtures/tls); they trust nothing real.
